
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    %% explicit, labeled start/end states (instead of the bare [*] UML markers)
    state "document uploaded" as start
    state "lifecycle complete" as done

    start --> pending
    pending --> processing: extract starts
    processing --> succeeded: fields stored
    processing --> failed: unreadable / error
    failed --> processing: retry
    processing --> processing: stale > 10 min → retry
    failed --> succeeded: manual correction
    succeeded --> done

    note right of succeeded
        Manual correction re-runs the
        deterministic requirements evaluator
    end note

    note right of failed
        Latest relevant document versions
        gate case submission
    end note

    note left of pending
        needs_document_reevaluation
        is server-controlled
    end note

    classDef ok fill:#064e3b,stroke:#10b981,color:#d1fae5
    classDef bad fill:#4c0519,stroke:#f43f5e,color:#fecdd3
    classDef busy fill:#0c4a6e,stroke:#38bdf8,color:#e0f2fe
    classDef idle fill:#1e293b,stroke:#64748b,color:#e2e8f0
    classDef terminal fill:#020617,stroke:#475569,color:#94a3b8

    class start idle
    class done terminal
    class succeeded ok
    class failed bad
    class processing busy
    class pending idle
